{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "69d60f45-1d38-8a0a-86ba-fdf45f5d1338",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T14:37:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kathleen Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:35:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:35:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Um, my name is Kathleen Quinn. I am calling about a water and sewer bill. It is for my rental, four fifty-seven Gibbs Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:35:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Quinn. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:35:24-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got a reminder notice, a late notice. But I never got the first bill. They sent it to my old address. I did not know about it until the reminder came. And now there is a late charge? I think this is not fair."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:35:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So the original bill went to the previous mailing address on file, and the reminder is what finally reached you. Let me pull the account up. Do you have the notice in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:35:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The amount is high also. Higher than usual. I had a plumber come out last month, to fix a leak, and I kept the receipt. So maybe the reading is wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:36:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be. A leak can bump up usage, and the repair receipt helps. Hang on a second, I'm looking at the readings. [pause] Yeah, I see the mailing address is the old one. That's why it went astray."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:36:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you can take off the late charge? I would like a supervisor to review it, please. Is there a supervisor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:36:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't waive it myself, but I can send it to my supervisor. You can send a copy of the plumber receipt too. Do you want the mailing address updated now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:36:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Update it. Sorry, your name is Tony, and the last name? I did not catch. It sounded like, um, ferry? Like the boat?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:36:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ferreira. F-E-R-R-E-I-R-A. Easy to mishear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:36:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ferreira. Okay. Not ferry. Sorry. Ferreira."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:36:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble. Is the best callback number the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:36:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is four zero one, five five five, zero one five six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:36:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll note the address change and the supervisor review. You can email or drop off the receipt, and someone will call you back in a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:37:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Mr. Ferry... Ferreira. Thank you."
    }
  ],
